{"title":"1980 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/5/4a50139cde83e8ef17dcbb8049e7175788d36065.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a679b$\" width=\"44\" height=\"12\" /> is the decimal expansion of a number in base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, such that it is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/d/94db15b430439ad5b3c80bfacfef0c6499ede2ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$72$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />, determine <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/b/e9bdf3e496517e8f8742f81dd774be1f93cf6e8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" />. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Write <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/5/4a50139cde83e8ef17dcbb8049e7175788d36065.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a679b$\" width=\"44\" height=\"12\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/8/db802ddbd28b66a9d523f1533acec67dd0986c8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a679b = 10000a + 6790 + b = 72n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"265\" height=\"14\" />, for some integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/8/3c8be65300706746df8ec31464daa85126e7ab3d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$72 = 8 \\times 9$\" width=\"82\" height=\"12\" />, we look at this equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/7/e077e5c28457949ce41eddb6aa86ca9ae7e32ee4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mod 8$\" width=\"61\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/8/668cc6d5e3172d24063e78fe86016c80c7cc2165.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mod 9$\" width=\"61\" height=\"12\" />. \n</p><p><br />\nLooking at the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/7/e077e5c28457949ce41eddb6aa86ca9ae7e32ee4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mod 8$\" width=\"61\" height=\"12\" />:\n</p>\n<center>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/6/8265a133f4ece9fe759ca39b8d33067181438233.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\begin{matrix} 10000a + 6790 + b \\equiv 0 + 6 + b &amp;\\equiv&amp; 0 \\mod 8        \\\\  6 + b &amp;\\equiv&amp; 0 \\mod  8          \\\\ b &amp;\\equiv&amp; 2 \\mod 8 \\end{matrix}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"356\" height=\"52\" />\n</p>\n</center>\n<p>Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/7/197213da9d06b2c5b59a10ad17f6a4aeb43d6697.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p><p>Substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/6/7d65baaf9671227780dd04ab952911036aa5c868.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" /> into the equation, and looking at the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/8/668cc6d5e3172d24063e78fe86016c80c7cc2165.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mod 9$\" width=\"61\" height=\"12\" />:\n</p>\n<center>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/1/771561f5c34ba0409d3b10e62e33dde312966b95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\begin{matrix} 10000a + 6790 + b \\equiv a + 6792 &amp;\\equiv&amp; 0 \\mod 9        \\\\  a+6 &amp;\\equiv&amp; 0 \\mod  9          \\\\ a &amp;\\equiv&amp; 3 \\mod 9 \\end{matrix}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"354\" height=\"52\" />\n</p>\n</center>\n<p>Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/b/33b3c27171aba2140505212ce5b912115d1cdd69.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, we get the 5 digit number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/5/ec5a95d51b16a89c1ca4b32dd41fd47338b1a80c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$36792$\" width=\"44\" height=\"12\" />, which is indeed divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/d/94db15b430439ad5b3c80bfacfef0c6499ede2ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$72$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />, thus satisfying requirements. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/3/873d6b4ca744e2a8a76dca3d48a30d20e4dc663d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 3, b = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"91\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_Canadian_MO\" title=\"1980 Canadian MO\">1980 Canadian MO</a></li></ul>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_Canadian_MO\" title=\"1980 Canadian MO\">1980 Canadian MO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_Canadian_MO_Problems\" title=\"1980 Canadian MO Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1980 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1980 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1980 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1980 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1980 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017113255\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.024 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.072 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 131/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 721/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 48/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3586/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   44.553      1 Template:CanadaMO_box\n100.00%   44.553      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:10531:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017113255 and revision id 43716. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}